{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/bc8c38e2ef500653a87fd36c07d217a4.avif?t=1772685091\" width=600 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of <strong>My Fairy Princess</strong> takes place in a peaceful paradise where humans, demons, and immortals live together.Here, you will act as her father or mother, holding your daughter\u2019s hand, walking through beautiful mountains and rivers, and wandering through lively mortal  this secluded fairyland, every choice shapes her fate.Will she live an ordinary life, or rise to become an immortal?This journey of growth is written by you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/a58a36548c3fbe7be26fc12e812debdd.avif?t=1772685091\" width=671 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say goodbye to boring number grinding.Besides daily schedules, farming, cooking, fishing, and alchemy all help your daughter grow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/9d0fce41a455c3ed49e7c246b8dd657a.poster.avif?t=1772685091\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/9d0fce41a455c3ed49e7c246b8dd657a.webm?t=1772685091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/9d0fce41a455c3ed49e7c246b8dd657a.mp4?t=1772685091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/2e90a5dba5f07cbb21300f96202077fa.poster.avif?t=1772685091\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/2e90a5dba5f07cbb21300f96202077fa.webm?t=1772685091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/2e90a5dba5f07cbb21300f96202077fa.mp4?t=1772685091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following your own parenting style, you will guide her toward the future you both hope for.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/a729f1bd06f0dc0152a6e99b912c127a.avif?t=1772685091\" width=1402 height=788 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/0ee5cc42f1105ab1b08f8aa1da17a0a4.avif?t=1772685091\" width=1402 height=788 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/079e35eade8856d3321e90c849fa67d0.avif?t=1772685091\" width=671 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fairyland is small, but full of life.Dozens of distinct characters await you: a wealthy young lady, a free-spirited wanderer, a dedicated cultivator, and more.They are not just scenery along her path, but potential companions.Every bond you build will deeply influence her love and destiny.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/8d3a2cb7b8e39e3faa2a50a96c1f402f.avif?t=1772685091\" width=1402 height=788 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/5b39446953b0b5c6dd25e51fbde53c85.avif?t=1772685091\" width=1402 height=788 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/965faef031d8ccf8dbdbdb86adc994db.avif?t=1772685091\" width=1402 height=788 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/2bed5ccaeac9dd88f0f0cccc0c36bad3.avif?t=1772685091\" width=671 height=70 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices guide your daughter\u2019s entire life. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/8cb29e1f36f9424cf9fd3a4adc638574.avif?t=1772685091\" width=1402 height=788 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a legendary healer to a charming enchantress;from a noble immortal prodigy to a brave chivalrous hero \u2014many endings and hidden careers await discovery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/1cefcced314ff1cb41420930ee3d47bb.avif?t=1772685091\" width=1402 height=788 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/ddf38e3e0b54132cca9f5e009a3da7e2.avif?t=1772685091\" width=671 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the fairyland, the scenery changes with the seasons.Wander the towns, and you may trigger unexpected side stories and feel the warmth of mortal life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/f52f8e95d6697bd01010de022ce412b8.poster.avif?t=1772685091\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/f52f8e95d6697bd01010de022ce412b8.webm?t=1772685091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/f52f8e95d6697bd01010de022ce412b8.mp4?t=1772685091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside the fairyland lies a vast and dangerous world.Explore unique wild maps and master different combat styles.When facing evil foes?Draw your divine weapon and teach them some \u201cproper reason\u201d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/61cf2a037da7ae3634b74763e5f8a4cc.poster.avif?t=1772685091\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/61cf2a037da7ae3634b74763e5f8a4cc.webm?t=1772685091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/61cf2a037da7ae3634b74763e5f8a4cc.mp4?t=1772685091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/36d4cc1ff11d4bebc3780ab41e5939cd.avif?t=1772685091\" width=671 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One lifetime may leave regrets, but reincarnation brings new chances.As you complete more playthroughs, hidden stories, special characters, and secret endings will unlock one by one.A casual meeting in one life may b